 "html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>Moët &amp; Chandon Champagne XXL méretű pezsgő hűtőtál</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Fényvisszaverő tükör design arany belsővel, matt fekete külsővel.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Legmagasabb pontja: 24,5 cm<br>A legalacsonyabb pont: 18,5 cm<br>Átmérője: 36,5 cm</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Vadonatúj, sohasem volt használva.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Moët &amp; Chandon</strong> Champagne Bucket (Black &amp; Gold)</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Highest point ca 24,5 cm<br>Lowest point ca 18,5 cm<br>Diameter ca 36,5 cm</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Moët &amp; Chandon</strong> black Cooler Bucket / Vasque Double magnum</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Champagne <strong>Moët &amp; Chandon</strong> Black Cooler / Bucket / Vasque Double magnum</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-larger-font-size\">See more <strong>Moët &amp; Chandon Champagne gifts and barware</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-larger-font-size\">Tekintse meg további <strong>Moët &amp; Chandon Champagne ajándékainkat és bárkellékeinket</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color has-larger-font-size wp-elements-3a245b3b17cc2c3abc63f4690c8ccee3\"><strong>Rendeljen egy maximum 8 fős Moët &amp; Chandon pezsgőkóstolót a kertjébe</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Érdeklődés és időpont egyeztetés: </p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-5 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/champagneclub.hu/\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-6 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n",
